# Deploy the app source only. Patterns are ANCHORED with a leading slash —
# an unanchored `supabase/` also matches src/lib/supabase/ and silently
# removes the Supabase client from the upload, which broke the first deploy
# with 19 module-not-found errors.
.env*
/supabase/
/scripts/
/docs/
/deploy/
node_modules/
.next/
*.log
